Ladybird fires windows.onFocusChanged once for each change of the
focused browser window, and with WINDOW_ID_NONE when focus leaves
every window of the browser, as Firefox’s ext-windows.js does through
its windowTracker focus events and Chromium’s WindowsEventRouter::
OnActiveWindowChanged; an extension that may not see a private window
hears WINDOW_ID_NONE for it, as in Firefox’s canAccessWindow check.
